Cell["\<\
As one can see, the two records agree to the accuracy of the time integration \
at every loss rate, including the strong-loss ones where the field loses most \
of its energy. Plot them for a lossless and a lossy cavity; solid lines are \
the coherent field, dashed lines the phase-randomized one:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->1896945989,ExpressionUUID->"6b853673-18d0-d9fa-19ba-a83d996aabc0"],

