Cell["\<\
As expected, it is zero up to rounding: the bound never fails. Plot both \
negative volumes for each loss rate, solid for the coherent field and dashed \
for the phase-randomized one; the shaded band is the negativity that the \
record cannot guarantee:\
\>", "Text",
 CellID->530774412,ExpressionUUID->"6a04a347-6624-93dc-1a3b-3b2113d6e126"],

