trajectory over the whole window. Now invert: recover ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  SubscriptBox[
   StyleBox["p", "TI"], 
   StyleBox["n", "TI"]]], "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "1cfb14f9-38ed-478b-4498-8da3b8982dd1"],
 " from the record alone by linear least squares. The largest error in the \
recovered distribution is:"
}], "Text",
